Full license texts
------------------

The complete license text of CPython and of every component above ships in
the `share/licenses/` directory of every output built with
`--embed-python=bundle`: the CPython text is copied from the bundled runtime
pack, the third-party texts are vendored in the compiler's package data
(`pyscriptc/pbs_licenses/`, refreshed from the python-build-standalone
`full` archive by scripts/sync_pbs_licenses.py), and this notice is copied
next to them. This file names the components; the texts travel with the
output. This file is generated by scripts/gen_third_party_notices.py;
edit the inputs, not the output.
